# ReadOS shell-language provenance

This crate is a ReadOS workspace member at `native/msp-shell-language`. It is a
standalone parser/AST boundary only: it never invokes PowerShell, `cmd.exe`, a
POSIX shell, or any other host process, and it has no dependency on the legacy
MSP Cargo workspace or source paths.

